  "body": "10 Orewa Heights Crescent, Orewa\r\n\r\n5 Bed | 3 Bath | 2 Living | 2 Garage | Legal Home & Income\r\n\r\nLooking for a home that gives you more space, more flexibility and more options? This impressive Orewa property delivers it all.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated and refreshed, the main home offers three generous bedrooms, stylish modern bathrooms and light-filled open-plan living. Step outside onto the spacious elevated deck and enjoy privacy, sunshine and views across Orewa with a glimpse of the sea.\r\n\r\nTHE BIG BONUS - LEGAL HOME & INCOME\r\n\r\nDownstairs is a fully self-contained legal two-bedroom home and income, complete with its own entrance and parking.\r\n\r\nPerfect for:\r\n\r\n• Extended family\r\n• Additional rental income\r\n• Older children or teenagers\r\n• Guests or boarders\r\n• Work-from-home flexibility\r\n\r\nAdd in solar water heating, heat pump, double internal-access garage, and excellent off-street parking with room for the boat or camper, and this home is seriously well equipped.\r\n\r\nOutside, the beautifully maintained section provides plenty of room for kids, pets and entertaining, surrounded by established greenery for added privacy.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Minutes from Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants, shops, schools and motorway access, with Silverdale just down the road.\r\n\r\nOne property. Two living options. Endless possibilities.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this much flexibility in Orewa don't come along every day.\r\n\r\nGet in touch with Team Steenberg today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nNo Stress, Just Success.",
